#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:558
#, no-wrap
msgid "Can the Norse spell _Eye of the Raven_ be used to reroll an opponent’s D6 dice roll?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:562
msgid "No. The spell only affects a single D6 rolled by the Norse player."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:564
msgid ""
"Armies book: xref:armies:norse.adoc#eye-of-the-raven[Norse – Eye of the "
"Raven]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:566
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do Skirmishers count towards the army break point? How about Chaos Spawn? If one does and the other doesn’t, why?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:570
msgid ""
"Skirmishers are not separate units so add nothing to break point. "
"Skirmishers are stands that increase the size of an existing unit."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:573
msgid ""
"A Chaos Spawn *is* a separate unit so does add to the break point. A Spawn "
"is a unit that may be brigaded with other units."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/rules/pages/questions-and-answers.adoc:575
msgid ""
"Armies book: xref:armies:empire.adoc#special-rules[Empire – Special rule 3] "
"(and others), xref:armies:chaos.adoc#special-rules[Chaos – Special rule 5] "
"(and others)."
msgstr ""
